Port the ODOS pml/osc UCX plugins from the DOCA 2.0 Comm Channel API to
DOCA >= 3.0 Comch (Comm Channel was removed in DOCA 3.x).

* send/recv go through odos_comch.h (copied in by apply_patches.sh), which
  keeps the blocking one-message semantics of ep_sendto/ep_recvfrom
* device filter: DMA job support (DOCA 2.0 API) -> Comch server/client cap
* DPU representor: odos_comch_open_rep() (rep[0] is now the uplink)
* renamed devinfo/rep/capability calls; libdoca_comch instead of
  libdoca_comm_channel; libraries found under lib/<arch>-linux-gnu or lib64
* server-start failure now returns OFFLOAD_FAIL (it returned a DOCA error
  code the caller did not treat as failure)

Against usman0xff/ompi-bf 62cef93ea961d587ec41cdb54a4d775fe0a70bda.

